{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n\n<p>發佈時間：21:46 2026-11-18 HKT</p>\n<img alt=\"「佐治傳奇」今季第二捷\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ur/sthl_square/e5c0cbb527f6c76ec17a7633a3efa88a/2026-11/r6_3.jpg\"/>\n<p>告東尼馬房的「佐治傳奇」，上場起步失機致敗後，今晚強配潘頓且抽得內檔，終於跑岀水準，直路上力壓「鄉村威龍」，贏得今季第二場頭馬，潘頓今晚亦起孖。</p>\n<p>今晚快活谷第六場四班一千米，潘頓策騎東廄的「佐治傳奇」勝出，取得今季第二捷，</p>\n<p>鄭加文說:「我最初以為『佐治傳奇』落敗，潘頓是冠軍騎師，冠軍即是冠軍，馬兒在他發揮下反先對手，非常精采。我覺得『佐治勇駒』可以攞勤工獎，馬兒今季跑了六場，無論放頭或留後，都能交出一段衝刺，告東尼也訓練得很好。由於另外兩位馬主李嘉俊和蔡敬業都是一齊在溫哥華St.George學校求學，我們三人讀同一間中學，所以叫做『佐治傳奇』。」</p>\n<h2>按下圖睇更多相片：</h2>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/30fed0c4f0bd2192547a9e548edb1789/2026-11/1b0104b4-c90e-4d0b-be86-bdc4c03507d2.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/f2fefad91039959ed7c0674561bb6b78/2026-11/02a78aa6-b5b6-4e69-8b71-5a734c390b98.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/a400561b985eb73a3f5d45fdb1c8a34b/2026-11/2e6b9b94-79c9-4a92-854d-b7ccabccc511.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/0e35a9029a7f87e686cffd41a252419b/2026-11/4aece4ab-6ba5-4039-a11b-565ae4bac548.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/031b50b9750a1d65428416389f61ae86/2026-11/7a943707-1dbb-4892-a1d7-42595f3b2699.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/2e7de0c77389a209658bf411584292d1/2026-11/9a44cdb9-58ce-4383-bf18-483da54b38f0.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/6f5f5cd9260e7bde0ba1132dd6f3bd32/2026-11/68e3d1f3-3041-48cd-9d99-ab4d7552a292.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/da610627ea251657aa5de000814fb143/2026-11/72eaa6dd-0362-41d5-80ac-2b5b758038eb.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/cbc3508d17ce052668bce016bedee0e1/2026-11/77a47282-0a2f-4816-a59e-96f62da2d1d9.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/12a1da05068ffa2c84b48e1661329f4c/2026-11/2884b240-6ed9-4598-a0db-92cfd5fae078.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/0adbfd4e9bbd076536f6dfa710484dd4/2026-11/8369d69a-6e3a-4b67-a290-085c2ce583a5.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/2fccd29990d61918725fb96e752a8381/2026-11/a44d4cad-bf64-4dc2-8da2-07ab04f2a844.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/5bfe0e53d7d5fe52ff9b797df095a684/2026-11/a323c534-84ba-47c2-9492-8e174ce78fd9.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/168e1f42d5cbf92c4e6673e4a5beff9b/2026-11/aad10ddd-d5d4-46c1-b62e-1a6511b9622b.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/a1ec615ddb0607d21b54e3bcf27af368/2026-11/abbe854a-fdd7-4447-97d5-e59c9521f5dc.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/474462045c8b0a447a528bfbe2733fbe/2026-11/b4115b10-8ccc-4cc9-80ac-8b4318a0b3e0.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/ff8d17401a6be2deee095349c6a41303/2026-11/dac6b55d-cf99-4539-afd8-26454edee9a3.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/f5f700510a21ab6c586d0e2be4777032/2026-11/dc41a575-b962-452a-94be-9ea7658400dc.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/1d33f64328810e86200c974931175889/2026-11/e2a155f6-bac9-4d3a-b662-a3eda5cc4e48.jpg\"/>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-18T14:29:59.765054+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":312,"images":20,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-18T13:46:59+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-19T00:57:37.887057+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-18T14:23:05.308293+00:00","content_hash":"cb2251883e55ac3909a4c4f3729469757c103a99c8c994dc9d714a5a5b9ab55f","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}